K1w1","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T23:27:26Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T23:27:26Z","body":"I don't understand the use case. Why are you saving player settings within the project? It will not work in an exported project unless you use the [persistent user data folder](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#accessing-persistent-user-data-user).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787859509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2789741567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105062#issuecomment-2789741567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105062","id":2789741567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mSBP_","user":{"login":"GreenCrowDev","id":62719360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzE5MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62719360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev","html_url":"https://github.com/GreenCrowDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T13:29:31Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T13:29:53Z","body":"> I don't understand the use case. Why are you saving player settings within the project? It will not work in an exported project unless you use the [persistent user data folder](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#accessing-persistent-user-data-user).\n\n@ydeltastar Thank you for the reference, I didn't know that.\nYou are right in the sense that this would not be a common use case.\nNonetheless I can see some custom use cases, e.g. plugin, or any other advanced workflow that may want to save resources in the project (project/plugin specific settings).\n\nI think that the API should provide a way to set the UID of a resource when overriding it...\nEven with some other methods from `ResourceUID` I wasn't able to accomplish it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2789741567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797467986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105062#issuecomment-2797467986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105062","id":2797467986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mvflS","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T16:48:16Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T16:48:16Z","body":"#99543 has resolved it, but only partially I think.\nWhen you save the Resource at runtime, the UID is gone. When you re-save it, a new UID will be generated.\nAfter restarting the project, once the Resource is re-saved again without UID, it will finally generate the same UID.\n\nThe first generated UID after #99543 will still be different, because it needs to generate the first deterministic UID.\nAfterwards if you want to re-generate the same UID, you need to restart the editor, otherwise the deleted UID will be in cache, so a subsequent one will be generated.\nIt's a bit convoluted, but this is not the issue that PR tried to fix, so it won't be working perfectly.\n\n> Nonetheless I can see some custom use cases, e.g. plugin, or any other advanced workflow that may want to save resources in the project (project/plugin specific settings).\n\nMost often such workflows run from the editor, so this problem does not exist.\nAlso plugins can save their settings in project settings or using ConfigFile. Using custom Resource for single configuration file makes no sense.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797467986/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798769365","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105062#issuecomment-2798769365","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105062","id":2798769365,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m0dTV","user":{"login":"GreenCrowDev","id":62719360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzE5MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62719360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev","html_url":"https://github.com/GreenCrowDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T10:06:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T10:06:09Z","body":"> Most often such workflows run from the editor, so this problem does not exist.\n\nNot sure what you mean, why it's not a problem if the workflow is only editor?\nWhat if there's an editor addon that for example manages and modifies some editor resource?\nThe resource is referenced by the UID because you may want to be able to change its folder location.\nBut because of the aforementioned issue you cannot keep the UID consistent, because it's gone on save from script.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798769365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798769812","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105062#issuecomment-2798769812","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105062","id":2798769812,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m0daU","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","